		<skos:changeNote>The https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/BE/20250301/GovernmentEntities/EuropeanJurisdiction/EasternEuropeGovernmentEntitiesAndJurisdictions.rdf version of the ontology was modified to address a typo (BE-245).</skos:changeNote>
		<skos:scopeNote>The initial version of this ontology reflects the national level only.</skos:scopeNote>
